Package: TSRClust
Type: Package
Title: Two-Stage Robust Clustering for Structural Minority Discovery
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hasan", "Bulut", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "hasan.bulut@example.com")
  )
Author: Hasan Bulut [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Hasan Bulut <hasan.bulut@example.com>
Description: Implements Two-Stage Robust Clustering (TSRClust), a method that
    first estimates dominant clusters using trimmed robust clustering and then
    revisits the trimmed residual set to detect dense structural minorities.
    The package provides the main clustering routine, simulation helpers, basic
    external evaluation metrics, and summary and plotting methods.
